entColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li></ul></div></div></aside></div><section class="cta-par"><img class="cta-img" src="/assets/img/photos/cta.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/cta-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/cta.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.16"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><h2>Didn’t see your question?</h2><p>Call or email — we’re glad to talk it through.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-l" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
